{"id":"656954","name":"菜脯焖河豚鱼","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/656954/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河豚鱼","amount":"4个"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"菜脯","amount":"适量（萝卜干）"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生姜洗净切细，菜脯干切块。","img":"images/656954/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"河豚鱼处理好的洗净。","img":"images/656954/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"适量五花肉切薄片。","img":"images/656954/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入五花肉。","img":"images/656954/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煸炒出油脂。","img":"images/656954/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入姜丝。","img":"images/656954/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入菜脯一起炒香。","img":"images/656954/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入河豚鱼。","img":"images/656954/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/656954/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上中小火焖15分钟左右入味。","img":"images/656954/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅前放入香葱段即可。","img":"images/656954/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656954/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656954/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/656954/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}